{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":78,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":22273,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1543333,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":233628,"Name":"acireta","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":197,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1320548176,"LastPoster":{"Id":282928,"Name":"Robersonpartyof2","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":34,"Preview":{"Id":1543333,"PostDate":1320548176,"PostContent":"I had never even heard of boarding pass invitations before I joined this forum, so when I first...","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ericataffs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.11.245.41","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1288624566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":197,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acireta","Id":233628,"Name":"acireta","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64344,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d204c224bd4bf822ee0641c7400e530b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;I had never even heard of boarding pass invitations before I joined this forum, so when I first saw them on here, I went through pretty much every boarding pass thread I could find. Thank you to so many ladies whose templates and pictures helped me SO much: Aylee, Becks, Island Princess, Jennie0521, BeckyN, Shoesiesluvr and many more. I also saw jmb0902\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s circular return address labels, and I knew I wanted to incorporate them: &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"..\/..\/..\/..\/..\/..\/t\/39572\/diy-return-address-labels-pics\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/39572\/diy-return-address-labels-pics&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m not sure if I started with Aylee&#039;s template, but I&#039;m sure whichever one I used came from her originally.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;I designed the boarding passes and address labels in Word, and the monogram, return address label and ticket jacket in PowerPoint. I love the end result!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;We had to make about 100 invitations, so the assembly was quite a project. Together, my FI and I did all the scoring, folding, gluing, cutting, corner punching, stuffing, belly banding and sealing. It was quite a task. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Tools:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Straight cutters \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Fiskars and X-acto (I prefer the Fiskars), Michaels&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Corner punch \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Fiskars, Michaels&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Bone folder and scoring board \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Martha Stewart, &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.save-on-crafts.com\/\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;www.Save-on-crafts.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Adhesive for bottom seam of the ticket jackets and belly bands: Elmer\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Craft Bond dual tip pen, Michaels (this stuff is cheap and awesome but a bit messy)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Materials:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Boarding passes and monograms on belly bands: Snow White 110lb cardstock, &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.cardsandpockets.com\/\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;www.cardsandpockets.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;, $32\/200 sheets&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Ticket jackets: Tabriz blue 110lb cardstock, &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.cardsandpockets.com\/\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;www.cardsandpockets.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;, $19\/100 sheets&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Black cardstock for belly bands: 65lb, Michaels, $1.50\/25 sheets&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Blue belly band ribbon: 1.5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d wide, Michaels, $4\/roll. We used approximately 6 rolls.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Envelopes: Nero (black) No. 10 envelopes, &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.envelopperinc.com\/\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;www.envelopperinc.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;, $23.80\/100 (nice heavy quality)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Wraparound labels: full page labels, Staples, $6\/25 sheets&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Total cost (not including tools which I had or were Christmas presents):&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt; $106&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Approximate cost per invitation:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt; $ 1.06&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Belly Band measurements:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Ribbon: 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 1.5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Black cardstock: 8.5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 1.75\u00e2\u20ac\u009d&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Belly band monogram measurements: &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Black backing square: 2\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 2\u00e2\u20ac\u009d&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Monogram square: 1.75\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 1.75\u00e2\u20ac\u009d&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;If you want to use the template, the downloaded fonts I used were Old Script and Wmtrees1 from &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.dafont.com\/\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;www.dafont.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;. Without these, these templates might look wonky. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;10931&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;boarding pass invite final p1.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;98&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;10932&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;boarding pass invite final p2.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;99&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;10933&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Ticket Jacket final.ppt&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;175&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;ppt&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;10934&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;wraparound address labels.docx&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;66&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;docx&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;ll post pics in the next post...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1543333,"PostDate":1320548176,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">I had never even heard of boarding pass invitations before I joined this forum, so when I first saw them on here, I went through pretty much every boarding pass thread I could find. Thank you to so many ladies whose templates and pictures helped me SO much: Aylee, Becks, Island Princess, Jennie0521, BeckyN, Shoesiesluvr and many more. I also saw jmb0902\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s circular return address labels, and I knew I wanted to incorporate them: <\/span><\/span><a href='..\/..\/..\/..\/..\/..\/t\/39572\/diy-return-address-labels-pics' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/39572\/diy-return-address-labels-pics<\/span><\/span><\/a><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">. <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm not sure if I started with Aylee's template, but I'm sure whichever one I used came from her originally.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">I designed the boarding passes and address labels in Word, and the monogram, return address label and ticket jacket in PowerPoint. I love the end result!<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">We had to make about 100 invitations, so the assembly was quite a project. Together, my FI and I did all the scoring, folding, gluing, cutting, corner punching, stuffing, belly banding and sealing. It was quite a task. <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><u><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Tools:<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/strong><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Straight cutters \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Fiskars and X-acto (I prefer the Fiskars), Michaels<\/span><\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Corner punch \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Fiskars, Michaels<\/span><\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Bone folder and scoring board \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Martha Stewart, <\/span><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.save-on-crafts.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">www.Save-on-crafts.com<\/span><\/span><\/a><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Adhesive for bottom seam of the ticket jackets and belly bands: Elmer\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Craft Bond dual tip pen, Michaels (this stuff is cheap and awesome but a bit messy)<\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><u><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Materials:<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/strong><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Boarding passes and monograms on belly bands: Snow White 110lb cardstock, <\/span><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.cardsandpockets.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">www.cardsandpockets.com<\/span><\/span><\/a><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">, $32\/200 sheets<\/span><\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Ticket jackets: Tabriz blue 110lb cardstock, <\/span><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.cardsandpockets.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">www.cardsandpockets.com<\/span><\/span><\/a><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">, $19\/100 sheets<\/span><\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Black cardstock for belly bands: 65lb, Michaels, $1.50\/25 sheets<\/span><\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Blue belly band ribbon: 1.5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d wide, Michaels, $4\/roll. We used approximately 6 rolls.<\/span><\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Envelopes: Nero (black) No. 10 envelopes, <\/span><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.envelopperinc.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">www.envelopperinc.com<\/span><\/span><\/a><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">, $23.80\/100 (nice heavy quality)<\/span><\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Wraparound labels: full page labels, Staples, $6\/25 sheets<\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <em><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Total cost (not including tools which I had or were Christmas presents):<\/span><\/span><\/em><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"> $106<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <em><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Approximate cost per invitation:<\/span><\/span><\/em><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"> $ 1.06<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><u><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Belly Band measurements:<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Ribbon: 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 1.5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Black cardstock: 8.5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 1.75\u00e2\u20ac\u009d<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><u><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Belly band monogram measurements: <\/span><\/span><\/u><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Black backing square: 2\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 2\u00e2\u20ac\u009d<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Monogram square: 1.75\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 1.75\u00e2\u20ac\u009d<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">If you want to use the template, the downloaded fonts I used were Old Script and Wmtrees1 from <\/span><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.dafont.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">www.dafont.com<\/span><\/span><\/a><span  style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">. Without these, these templates might look wonky. <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"10931\",\"name\":\"boarding pass invite final p1.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"98\",\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"10932\",\"name\":\"boarding pass invite final p2.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"99\",\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"10933\",\"name\":\"Ticket Jacket final.ppt\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"175\",\"type\":\"ppt\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"10934\",\"name\":\"wraparound address labels.docx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"66\",\"type\":\"docx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'll post pics in the next post...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ericataffs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.11.245.41","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1288624566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":197,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acireta","Id":233628,"Name":"acireta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64344,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5107acdd27cad6256df6ae30c796ad5a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"01.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585154\/width\/600\/height\/286\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"02.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585156\/width\/600\/height\/338\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"03.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585158\/width\/600\/height\/338\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"04.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585160\/width\/600\/height\/338\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"05.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585162\/width\/600\/height\/338\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"06.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585164\/width\/600\/height\/422\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"07.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585169\/width\/600\/height\/377\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"08.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585171\/width\/600\/height\/389\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"09.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585173\/width\/600\/height\/287\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"10.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585175\/width\/600\/height\/313\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"11.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585177\/width\/600\/height\/338\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1543336,"PostDate":1320548590,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"01.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585154\/width\/600\/height\/286\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"02.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585156\/width\/600\/height\/338\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"03.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585158\/width\/600\/height\/338\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"04.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585160\/width\/600\/height\/338\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"05.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585162\/width\/600\/height\/338\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"06.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585164\/width\/600\/height\/422\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"07.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585169\/width\/600\/height\/377\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"08.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585171\/width\/600\/height\/389\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"09.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585173\/width\/600\/height\/287\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"10.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585175\/width\/600\/height\/313\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"11.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/585177\/width\/600\/height\/338\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ericataffs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.11.245.41","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1288624566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":197,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acireta","Id":233628,"Name":"acireta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64344,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bd84a6be32e612c7c0adb4f09eeb415","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I love it!&amp;nbsp; You have doen a terrific job, especially like the wrap around addresses.&amp;nbsp; Can you tell me how you got the text like that I have been trying forever and can&#039;t get it!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1543341,"PostDate":1320549933,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I love it!\u00a0 You have doen a terrific job, especially like the wrap around addresses.\u00a0 Can you tell me how you got the text like that I have been trying forever and can't get it!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janette34@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1289612881,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233915.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"janette34","Id":233915,"Name":"janette34","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64344,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e974f03793edcca7cabbbe283c4bcb3a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I think this is the powerpoint I used for the return address label (can&#039;t open these at home, only at work). I&#039;m sorry, I can&#039;t remember exactly where to click to make the lettering curved...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;10935&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;return address label image.pptx&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;69&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;pptx&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1543347,"PostDate":1320551585,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I think this is the powerpoint I used for the return address label (can't open these at home, only at work). I'm sorry, I can't remember exactly where to click to make the lettering curved...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"10935\",\"name\":\"return address label image.pptx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"69\",\"type\":\"pptx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica 