ber","JoinDate":1421428169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1442083173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.147.126.215","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a242712658a500ffa623ff5190196dec","RawContent":"Hi Ladies! I hate commiting and then having to bail but I&#039;ve put October 2nd in my calendar and hope it works out. I&#039;d love to meet up with you ladies as you&#039;ve all inspired me so much. Not sure I&#039;ll have much to share as wedding planning has come to a complete halt but maybe this meet up will motivate me to get back at it. Talk soon.","Attachments":[],"Id":1904276,"PostDate":1441629076,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Ladies! I hate commiting and then having to bail but I've put October 2nd in my calendar and hope it works out. I'd love to meet up with you ladies as you've all inspired me so much. Not sure I'll have much to share as wedding planning has come to a complete halt but maybe this meet up will motivate me to get back at it. Talk soon. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestin