 Decorations - USED&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 30.00 (QTY 2)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#2a2a2a;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;2 White Starfish 3\" to 4\" w- Dried Dune Grass&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;Light LED FloraLytes Submersible White - NEW&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 15.00 (QTY 1 PKG of 10)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;Tealight Battery Operated 6\/Package* - NEW&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 15.00 (QTY 30 TEALIGHTS TOTAL)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;Raffia Waterfall 12oz Natural - NEW&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 3.00&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;Starfish Aisle Markers - USED&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 50.00 (Qty 10)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1746212,"PostDate":1365766892,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n  