  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">*Shirts, Pants & Dresses Samples (White, Ivory, Ecru)<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">*Pants Sample -- Khaki<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">3x3x3 Turquoise Favor Box-100pc - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 20.00 (QTY 76 boxes)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Favors - Yankee Candle Votive Holders - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 25.00 (5 bxs of 3 - 15 votive holders)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">ID Badge Holder \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Resealable, Vertical Orientation, 2.625 x 3.75 Inches, Pre-Punched, NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 10.00 (Qty 25)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">8 Blank Cotton Bags \u00e2\u20ac\u201c NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color:rgb(44,44,44)\"><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">Size: 22\"w x 15\"h w\/ 5\" bottom gusset and 25\" handles<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 15.00 (QTY 8)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">8 X 6 X 1-1\/2 SOFT VINYL SLIDE-ZIP POUCH (10 Pouches) \u00e2\u20ac\u201c NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Pouches were used for Survival Kits that included tissues, aloe, medications, hand sanitizer, etc. for each OOT Guest<\/span><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 8.00 (QTY 8)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Centerpieces -- Yankee Candle Aqua Glass Tealight Holders - NEW<\/span><\/str