w.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_14374\/sml_gallery_60953_14374_1386231067_201857.jpeg[\/img][\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\n[size=3][b][font=cambria]Centerpieces -- Yankee Candle Aqua Glass Tealight Holders - NEW[\/font][\/b][\/size][\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\n[size=3][font=cambria]I bought these to use for Centerpieces, but was subsequently told by the Atlantis that I could not use any glass items for decorations as the Reception was outdoors on a patio.[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\n[size=3][b][font=cambria]$ 25.00 EACH (QTY 4) (will include a set of LED tealights with each)[\/font][\/b][\/size][\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_14374\/sml_gallery_60953_14374_1386231067_201858.jpeg[\/img][\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\n[size=3][b][font=cambria]Centerpieces - Capiz Seashell Trays - USED[\/font][\/b][\/size][\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\n[size=3][font=cambria]*This price includes the trays and Tiffany Blue Sand and seashell, seaglass and starfish accessories - CANDLES NOT INCLUDED[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\n[size=3][b][font=cambria]$ 50.00 (QTY 4)[\/font][\/b][\/size][\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_14374\/sml_gallery_60953_14374_1386231067_201860.jpeg[\/img][\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\n[size=3][b][font=cambria]Light LED FloraLytes Submersible White - NEW[\/font][\/b][\/size][\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\n[size=3][b][font=cambria]$ 10.00 (QTY 1 PKG of 10)[\/font][\/b][\/size][\/font][\/color]","Attachments":[],"Id":1904747,"PostDate":1442311834,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>excpomelo, on 15 September 2015 - 04:50 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>you should add images for each item<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>The images were in the post above<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">3x3x3 Turquoise (Tiffany Blue) Favor Box - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">$ 20.00 (QTY 76 boxes) \/ $8.00 for 25 Boxes<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_14374\/sml_gallery_60953_14374_1386231066_201853.jpeg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_60953_14374_1386231066_20185\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">Favors - Yankee Candle Votive Holders - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">$ 20.00 (5 boxes of 3 - 15 votive holders)<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_14374\/sml_gallery_60953_14374_1386231066_201854.jpeg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_60953_14374_1386231066_20185\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">8 X 6 X 1-1\/2 SOFT VINYL SLIDE-ZIP POUCH (10 Pouches) \u00a0NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">Pouches were used for Survival Kits that included tissues, aloe, medications, hand sanitizer, etc. for each OOT Guest<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">$ 5.00 (QTY 8)<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_14374\/sml_gallery_60953_14374_1386231067_201857.jpeg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_60953_14374_1386231067_20185\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">Centerpieces -- Yankee Candle Aqua Glass Tealight Holders - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">I bought these to use for Centerpieces, but was subsequently told by the Atlantis that I could not use any glass items for decorations as the Reception was outdoors on a patio.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">$ 25.00 EACH (QTY 4) (will include a set of LED tealights with each)<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_14374\/sml_gallery_60953_14374_1386231067_201858.jpeg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_60953_14374_1386231067_20185\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">Centerpieces - Capiz Seashell Trays - USED<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">*This price includes the trays and Tiffany Blue Sand and seashell, seaglass and starfish accessories - CANDLES NOT INCLUDED<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">$ 50.00 (QTY 4)<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_14374\/sml_gallery_60953_14374_1386231067_201860.jpeg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_60953_14374_1386231067_20186\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">Light LED FloraLytes Submersible White - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">$ 10.00 (QTY 1 PKG of 10)<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tripledobedare@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"96.231.156.71","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1345162376,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259268.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dobedare","Id":259268,"Name":"dobedare","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
