{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ded88ab2e8d3e138ec0c27665f2def7a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m trying to decide which website to use for our wedding website. I&#039;ve read a lot of reviews on weddingwindow.com...Does anyone have any comments, insight on this site? Is it worth it to pay for the site, or just go with a free one?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;How did everyone set their site up? We are only inviting a certain amount of close friends and family to the actual ceremony in Jamaica. Then we will be having a larger reception when we return back home. Should I put the wedding website on the save the dates for the people that will NOT be invited to the ceremony? I don&#039;t want people to think they were left out because they will see all the information about the accommodations and such. Is there a way you can set up certain pages with certain passwords? Or should I just not put the website on the regular reception STDs?? Help!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1808358,"PostDate":1382260822,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm trying to decide which website to use for our wedding website. I've read a lot of reviews on weddingwindow.com...Does anyone have any comments, insight on this site? Is it worth it to pay for the site, or just go with a free one?\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>How did everyone set their site up? We are only inviting a certain amount of close friends and family to the actual ceremony in Jamaica. Then we will be having a larger reception when we return back home. Should I put the wedding website on the save the dates for the people that will NOT be invited to the ceremony? I don't want people to think they were left out because they will see all the information about the accommodations and such. Is there a way you can set up certain pages with certain passwords? Or should I just not put the website on the regular reception STDs?? Help!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennkn87@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"69.88.193.194","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378953642,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":227,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jennkn87","Id":273417,"Name":"Jennkn87","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d5e7d22831bdfd2650eff59e4eacd9f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I like the knot.com.. really really easy to use and has a guestbook and rsvp section!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1808546,"PostDate":1382359575,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I like the knot.com.. really really easy to use and has a guestbook and rsvp section!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.harmer6@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.129.72.221","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374172167,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271696.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sharmer","Id":271696,"Name":"sharmer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"def518fc31180d739f23e6d5e3ad405c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I used wedsite and it was easy and reasonable.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810104,"PostDate":1382985632,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I used wedsite and it was easy and reasonable.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mhrushin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.75.188.101","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1367955171,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269377.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mayahouse","Id":269377,"Name":"mayahouse","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.97.112.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fea231adfba4a27802c7cf096929099c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;we did the knot.&amp;nbsp; Loved it!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1832775,"PostDate":1391940725,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>we did the knot.\u00a0 Loved it!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"meghartman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.97.112.145","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374432186,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271770.jpg?_r=1391556917","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":159,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"megan224","Id":271770,"Name":"megan224","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e931ffb84f09cfa331397676ba316d2","RawContent":"I&#039;m using my wedding.com. Love that I can add music to the site.","Attachments":[],"Id":1832778,"PostDate":1391940933,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm using my wedding.com. Love that I can add music to the site.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.119.64.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb731e402660ff107bd8382c7331b72c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I went with WeddingWire.&amp;nbsp; Stuck with the free acount and it&#039;s totally getting the job done.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1833408,"PostDate":1392222357,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I went with WeddingWire.\u00a0 Stuck with the free acount and it's totally getting the job done.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kellis_baby@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.222.71.55","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1386889365,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275607.jpg?_r=1425326341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellisbaby","Id":275607,"Name":"kellisbaby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.177.132.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7dbcf530716b7ff805bacde72313cf1b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;knot.com as well!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1834478,"PostDate":1392751504,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>knot.com as well!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mvee1025@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.177.132.210","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359850900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265570.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mvee1025","Id":265570,"Name":"mvee1025","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.153.117.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1351eb6f33906068040bec5296fe5626","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The knot&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1839131,"PostDate":1395180585,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The knot<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"curltop475@aol.com","IpAddress":"68.39.65.38","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1376387605,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272533.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":89,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Traci Felton","Id":272533,"Name":"Traci Felton","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1960bcb529834be4085164f278c66f6a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My resort package came with one for free... I still have to set it up.... We set up a wedding FB page, so I&#039;m still trying to decide if it&#039;s worth the work!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1841485,"PostDate":1396266248,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My resort package came with one for free... I still have to set it up.... We set up a wedding FB page, so I'm still trying to decide if it's worth the work!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bambiderby@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1395161860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277216.jpg?_r=1395766815","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":218,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"forevertogether","Id":277216,"Name":"forevertogether","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.46.112.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a7facd5de23fc8dce5e220445b2dcb6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think the knot is the easiest to use and the personalized domain name is totally worth it. It so much simpler to spread the word of your website if its short and easy to remember.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849554,"PostDate":1399756898,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think the knot is the easiest to use and the personalized domain name is totally worth it. It so much simpler to spread the word of your website if its short and easy to remember.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kathyandethan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.46.112.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1399260140,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277838.jpg?_r=1399427613","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KathyandEthan","Id":277838,"Name":"KathyandEthan","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":32,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
